  "response": "Beneath the veil of stars, the heart remains,\nA silent flame that burns through endless night,\nWhere time dissolves in ancient, hushed domains,\nAnd fleeting days surrender to the light.\nNo storm of years can quench this sacred fire,\nNor distance break the bond that holds us true,\nWe stand as pillars in the shifting mire,\nRooted in the earth, yet touching blue.\nThe world may fade to dust and silent stone,\nBut love, a river, flows beyond the shore,\nA song that hums in every seed and sown,\nForevermore, forevermore.\nSo let the ages turn their golden wheel,\nOur souls are bound by an eternal seal.",
